<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Metroplex suspends stock.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Metroplex suspends stock.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Metroplex Bhd was suspended following a request from the company, the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The main board listed property developer Metroplex Bhd said it had requested the suspension to make an announcement.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
</text>
